    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Meet the legendary gods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient legend circulates on the island, and it is said that powerful gods live here, and they have the power to fulfill any wish. But remember, the fulfillment of each wish comes with a price. Are you ready for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Find the missing mother</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist, a brave explorer, embarks on a journey to find his missing mother. Her last clue points to Beast Island. In order to solve the mystery of his mother's disappearance, he must go deep into this island full of unknowns and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Click to decrypt the adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Beast Island&quot; is a challenging click to decrypt game. You will explore by clicking and solving puzzles to uncover the truth hidden behind the ancient legend. Every choice may have unexpected consequences, and every puzzle tests your wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f Uncover the fog and discover the truth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Join this adventure, uncover the secrets of Beast Island, find your mother, how will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Game Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost no natural language text in the game flow</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional point-and-click puzzles, easy to play</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique minimalistic art style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scene has a unique impressive soundtrack</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where realism and magic meet</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Meet the legendary gods</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient legend circulates on the island, and it is said that powerful gods live here, and they have the power to fulfill any wish. But remember, the fulfillment of each wish comes with a price. Are you ready for the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d Find the missing mother</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist, a brave explorer, embarks on a journey to find his missing mother. Her last clue points to Beast Island. In order to solve the mystery of his mother's disappearance, he must go deep into this island full of unknowns and dangers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Click to decrypt the adventure</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Beast Island&quot; is a challenging click to decrypt game. You will explore by clicking and solving puzzles to uncover the truth hidden behind the ancient legend. Every choice may have unexpected consequences, and every puzzle tests your wisdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2a\ufe0f Uncover the fog and discover the truth</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? Join this adventure, uncover the secrets of Beast Island, find your mother, how will you choose?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca1 Game Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Almost no natural language text in the game flow</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traditional point-and-click puzzles, easy to play</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique minimalistic art style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each scene has a unique impressive soundtrack</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where realism and magic meet</p></li></ul>",
